-- VACUUM to clean dead tuples (required for shrink to detect freed pages)
VACUUM perf_shrink;
VACUUM
Time: 76.299 ms
VACUUM perf_vacuum;
VACUUM
Time: 72.844 ms
VACUUM perf_reindex;
VACUUM
